usb_timeout: 5
Version: 2095825-diagnostic
Usage: env /home/ubuntu/ios13-analysis/builds/gaster-diagnostic options
env:
USB_TIMEOUT - USB timeout in ms
GASTER_USB_TRACE=1 - Trace setup packets, backend results and timing (no payload data)
options:
reset - Reset DFU state
pwn - Put the device in pwned DFU mode
decrypt src dst - Decrypt file using GID0 AES key
decrypt_kbag kbag - Decrypt KBAG using GID0 AES key
probe - Probe the RPC on an already-pwned N61AP; no automatic exploit/reset
decrypt_kbag_pwned kbag - Decrypt KBAG on an already-pwned N61AP; no automatic exploit/reset
